# The fetched tier's exclusions (ADR-0026, amendment of step 9): a part
# whose survey meets a kernel bug waits on the regression/ fixture the bug
# was shrunk to, `<part> <regression/slug>` per line. tools/real-parts.sh
# fails on a failure no line excludes, on a wait whose fixture has left
# regression/, and on a part that passes yet still waits.

# A mesh point off its face by more than the face's tolerance.
nist_ftc_10_asme1_ap242-e2 regression/nist-ftc-10-ap242-mesh-off-face
# A battery drill that returns Internal(Geometry).
nist_ctc_04_asme1_ap203 regression/nist-ctc-04-ap203-drill-geometry-fault
# Parts that read since the reader heals (ADR-0058), and what they meet.
# A read past ADR-0026 §6's budget.
nist_ctc_02_asme1_ap203 regression/nist-ctc-02-ap203-slow-band-fits
# A mesh point off its face by more than the face's tolerance.
nist_ctc_04_asme1_ap242-e1 regression/nist-ctc-04-ap242-mesh-off-face
# A battery box cut or drill that returns Internal(Split).
nist_ftc_07_asme1_ap242-e2 regression/nist-ftc-07-ap242-box-cut-split-fault
